https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-024-02497-y
Original scan-derived body: Lobato-Rios et al. (2022), Nature Methods.
https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-022-01466-7

Modified for Fly Ask: simplified STL meshes converted to an indexed GLB,
left-side meshes mirrored for the right side, neutral leg pose applied,
coordinate axes converted for Three.js, and web materials assigned.
Flight, wing folding, leg tucking, antenna/head motion, and landing are
application-authored animations, not MuJoCo physics or recorded kinematics.
